<view class="screen">
  <view class="eyebrow">MAKE YOURSELF AT HOME</view>
  <view class="page-title settings-title">让小窝，更合你意。</view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">个人与偏好</text></view>
  <view class="paper">
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="profile"><van-icon name="user-o" size="22"
        color="#9cac85" /><text class="menu-copy">个人资料</text><van-icon name="arrow" size="13"
        color="#b0bba1" /></view>
    <view class="menu-row"><van-icon name="bell" size="22" color="#9cac85" /><text
        class="menu-copy">本地通知偏好</text>
      <switch checked="{{notification}}" color="#a8b88c" bindchange="toggle"
        style="transform:scale(.75);transform-origin:right center" />
    </view>
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="privacy"><van-icon name="shield-o" size="22"
        color="#9cac85" /><text class="menu-copy">隐私说明</text><van-icon name="arrow" size="13"
        color="#b0bba1" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">关于小窝</text></view>
  <view class="paper">
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="feedback"><van-icon name="comment-o" size="22"
        color="#9cac85" /><text class="menu-copy">意见反馈</text><van-icon name="arrow" size="13"
        color="#b0bba1" /></view>
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="about"><van-icon name="info-o" size="22" color="#9cac85" /><text
        class="menu-copy">关于校窝</text><text class="menu-description">v1.1.0</text><van-icon
        name="arrow" size="13" color="#b0bba1" /></view>
    <view class="menu-row" bindtap="reset"><van-icon name="replay" size="22" color="#bd9a75" /><text
        class="menu-copy reset-text">重置演示内容</text><van-icon name="arrow" size="13"
        color="#b0bba1" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="form-note settings-note">当前使用本地模拟接口 · 个人数据仅保存在本机<view class="line-break"></view>
    通知偏好仅本地保存，暂不会收到服务推送</view>
</view>
